number: XI
name: The Heir
path: M6 4.333s.73-.561 0-1.666C5.27 1.56 6 1 6 1M4.25 5 6 7.725 7.75 5M1 6.725h2.25L6 11l2.75-4.275H11
uprightMeaning: ending, cycle, succession
reversedMeaning: unnatural prolonging, refused ending
tags: season:autumn, element:wood, gem:amethyst, flower:rose
flavor: The bleeding moon rises. Below it, two doors stand open.

--- upright
What is ending was always going to end. The cycle does not require permission. What follows has waited long enough.
---

--- reversed
The body has ended. The hand on it has not. The refusal costs more than the ending it was meant to prevent.
---
